{"name":"Medici Blue","hex":"#104773","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"}],"entries":[{"title":"House of Medici","blocks":[{"text":"The House of Medici was an Italian banking family and political dynasty that first consolidated power in the Republic of Florence under Cosimo de' Medici and his grandson Lorenzo \"the Magnificent\" during the first half of the 15th century. The family originated in the Mugello region of Tuscany, and prospered gradually in trade until it was able to fund the Medici Bank. This bank was the largest in Europe in the 15th century and facilitated the Medicis' rise to political power in Florence, although they officially remained citizens rather than monarchs until the 16th century."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Augmented_Arms_of_Medici.svg/330px-Augmented_Arms_of_Medici.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_Medici","wikidata":"Q170022"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Giovanni_di_Bicci_de%27_Medici.jpg/250px-Giovanni_di_Bicci_de%27_Medici.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/Giovanni_di_Bicci_de%27_Medici.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Giovanni_di_Bicci_de%27_Medici.jpg/250px-Giovanni_di_Bicci_de%27_Medici.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Giovanni di Bicci de' Medici, founder of the Medici bank","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGiovanni_di_Bicci_de'_Medici.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Ghirlandaio_a-pucci-lorenzo-de-medici-f-sassetti_1.jpg/250px-Ghirlandaio_a-pucci-lorenzo-de-medici-f-sassetti_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/Ghirlandaio_a-pucci-lorenzo-de-medici-f-sassetti_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Ghirlandaio_a-pucci-lorenzo-de-medici-f-sassetti_1.jpg/250px-Ghirlandaio_a-pucci-lorenzo-de-medici-f-sassetti_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Confirmation of the Rule, by Domenico Ghirlandaio","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGhirlandaio_a-pucci-lorenzo-de-medici-f-sassetti_1.jpg"},{